=== Failed candidacies ===
These individuals failed to submit the required number of endorsement signatures.
* {{ill|Dražen Keleminec|hr}} ([[Autochthonous Croatian Party of Rights|A-HSP]]), Incumbent president of [[Autochthonous Croatian Party of Rights]] (A-HSP) since 2005. His bid was announced on 21 September 2024.<ref>{{cite web |title=Dražen Keleminec najavio kandidaturu za predsjednika Republike |url=https://www.tportal.hr/vijesti/clanak/drazen-keleminec-najavio-kandidaturu-za-predsjednika-republike-20240919 |website=tportal.hr |access-date=28 September 2024}}</ref> Submitted 10,932 on 10 December.<ref>{{cite web |title=Keleminec predao potpise za kandidaturu: DIP me nije puštao zbog prvog bijelog polja |url=https://n1info.hr/vijesti/keleminec-predao-potpise-za-kandidaturu/ |website=n1info.hr |date=10 December 2024 |access-date=10 December 2024}}</ref> On 11 December, his bid was rejected by the State Electoral Commission because he failed to submit the required number of endorsement signatures. Only 7,712 signatures were verified as authentic.<ref>{{cite web |title=Rješenje kojim se odbija prijedlog kandidata Dražena Keleminca za predsjednika Republike Hrvatske |url=https://www.izbori.hr/site/UserDocsImages/2024/Izbori_za_predsjednika_Republike_Hrvatske/Rjesenja_o_prigovorima/Rje%C5%A1enje%20-%20Dra%C5%BEen%20Keleminec.pdf |website=izbori.hr |access-date=12 December 2024}}</ref>
* Slobodan Midžić ([[Independent politician|independent]]), a potential [[perennial candidate]] who submitted just one signature of endorsement on 9 December.<ref name=candidates/><ref>{{cite web |title=Bliži se rok za predaju potpisa za predsjedničku kampanju |url=https://n1info.hr/video/n1-info/blizi-se-rok-za-predaju-potpisa-za-predsjednicku-kampanju/ |website=n1info.hr |date=9 December 2024 |access-date=10 December 2024}}</ref> On 11 December, his bid was rejected by the State Electoral Commission because he failed to submit the required number of endorsement signatures.<ref>{{cite web |title=Rješenje kojim se odbija prijedlog kandidata Slobodana Midžića za predsjednika Republike Hrvatske |url=https://www.izbori.hr/site/UserDocsImages/2024/Izbori_za_predsjednika_Republike_Hrvatske/Rjesenja_o_prigovorima/Rje%C5%A1enje%20-%20Slobodan%20Mid%C5%BEi%C4%87.pdf |website=izbori.hr |access-date=12 December 2024}}</ref> He had previously unsuccessfully attempted to become a candidate in [[2009–10 Croatian presidential election|2009]], [[2014–15 Croatian presidential election|2014]], and [[2019–20 Croatian presidential election|2019]] elections.
*Pavle Perović (independent). His bid was announced on 13 November 2024.<ref>{{cite web |title=Raspored zaprimanja prijedloga kandidata |url=https://www.izbori.hr/site/UserDocsImages/2024/Izbori_za_predsjednika_Republike_Hrvatske/Raspored%20zaprimanja%20prijedloga%20kandidata/najava_2.12.2024.(2).pdf |website=Državno izborno povjerenstvo Republike Hrvatske}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |title=Ovaj Zadranin želi u utrku za predsjednika države, no treba vašu pomoć |url=https://023.hr/2024/11/ovaj-zadranin-zeli-u-utrku-za-predsjednika-drzave-no-treba-vasu-pomoc/ |website=023.hr |language=hr |date=14 November 2024}}</ref>
